  "scope": "Replace a manual six-step Pell ordinate calculation by recurrence simplification and ring normalization; 24 net lines removed.",
  "validation": "Paired target and three direct clients pass, with byte-identical client objects. Eight object-pinned target probes report equal names, types, axioms and sampled simp/instance registrations. A second carrier replay used source-matched updated NegativeNorms, SignedPairs and equation-syntax objects; both phase objects equal the initial client object.",
  "limitations": [
    "No raw logs or compiled objects are included. External records, logs, source samples and scripts are available only at the recorded temporary paths and may expire. Full replay requires those artifacts and their dependencies.",
    "The target and direct clients were checked, not the full current-source transitive closure. Reports do not show equality of proof bodies or every persistent extension.",
    "An early provider refresh failed before elaboration due to an incomplete overlay and was followed by two successful source-matched replays. The first successful replay predated a subsequent NegativeNorms source update; the second includes that update."
